ram's effect would be the difference between these two changes: (Treatment Change) - (Control Change). This approach assumes that, in the absence of the program, the unemployment trends in both groups would have been parallel.\", \"e\": \"Can the 3 pp reduction be attributed to the program? No. What is the correct interpretation? [CONFOUNDED]\"}"
